{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/746084-shouldn-t-solar-counterattack-be-perilous-like-solar-cross-counter","id":746084,"title":"Shouldn't Solar Counterattack be Perilous like Solar Cross-Counter?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-11-01T01:37:30-07:00","id":746084,"title":"Shouldn't Solar Counterattack be Perilous like Solar Cross-Counter?","content":"Shouldn't Solar Counterattack be Perilous like Solar Cross-Counter?<br /> When you are in Initiative Crash, you cannot lauch decisive attacks so you can't use Solar Counterattack, right?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1005-lukezs","name":"LukeZS","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1005_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"27"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-01T01:56:37-07:00","id":746123,"title":"","content":"It doesn't need the keyword, since as you note you can't make decisive attacks while crashed anyway, so you're already prevented from activating Solar Counterattack. Perilous should be removed from Solar Cross-Counter, not added to Solar Counterattack.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">My homebrew: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1244979-abyssals-a-shadow-falls\" target=\"_blank\">Abyssals,</a> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1065949-infernals-to-rule-in-hell-complete-edition\" target=\"_blank\">Infernals,</a> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/781489-ex3-dragon-kings-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">Dragon Kings,</a> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1058142-lanaya-s-martial-arts-homebrew-compendium\" target=\"_blank\">martial arts.</a></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3559-lanaya","name":"Lanaya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3559_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"960"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-01T01:57:34-07:00","id":746129,"title":"","content":"Solar Cross-Counter doesn't use initiative, so if it's not perilous, you could use it to make a decisive while crashed. Solar Counterattack is still a decisive, so if you're crashed you can't use it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><span style=\"color:#696969\">When all the world was very young<br /> And mountain magic heavy hung<br /> The supermen would walk in file<br /> Guardians of a loveless isle</span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2010-root","name":"Root","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2010_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1014"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-01T01:00:40-08:00","id":746133,"title":"","content":"It would be redundant to apply the perilous keyword to charms that have the decisive-only keyword because that already covers that they can't be used in Initiative crash for exactly the reason you mention.<br /> <br /> The perilous keyword is for charms that, if they didn't have the keyword, could still possibly be used in Initiative Crash.<br /> <br /> So actually, it seems like the issue here is that Solar Cross-Counter has a tag, and a condition to remove that tag, that are irrelevant because it's decisive-only nature is still preventing it from being used in Initiative Crash even without the perilous tag on it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Not so noble anymore.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1823-drake","name":"Drake","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1823_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"456"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-01T01:04:38-08:00","id":746136,"title":"","content":"Ok, I see it. You can have Decisive-only charms that don't use the standard Decisive attacks resolution, this is why Solar Cross-Counter has the Perilous keyword added.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1005-lukezs","name":"LukeZS","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1005_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"27"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-01T01:05:34-08:00","id":746139,"title":"","content":"Solar Cross-Counter can drop the perilous tag for an extra WP at E3+. If that did nothing, then the player would be subjecting himself to scorn for throwing away a WP. This seems like a harsh rule.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><span style=\"color:#696969\">When all the world was very young<br /> And mountain magic heavy hung<br /> The supermen would walk in file<br /> Guardians of a loveless isle</span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2010-root","name":"Root","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2010_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1014"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-01T01:06:11-08:00","id":746140,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LukeZS</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/746084-shouldn-t-solar-counterattack-be-perilous-like-solar-cross-counter?p=746136#post746136\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ok, I see it. You can have Decisive-only charms that don't use the standard Decisive attacks resolution, this is why Solar Cross-Counter has the Perilous keyword added.</div> </div> </div> </div>No, it doesn't actually work by RAW (although the intent is clear). Using a different damage calculation doesn't change the fact that being crashed prevents you from making decisive attacks at all. It's just an error.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">My homebrew: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1244979-abyssals-a-shadow-falls\" target=\"_blank\">Abyssals,</a> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1065949-infernals-to-rule-in-hell-complete-edition\" target=\"_blank\">Infernals,</a> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/781489-ex3-dragon-kings-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">Dragon Kings,</a> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1058142-lanaya-s-martial-arts-homebrew-compendium\" target=\"_blank\">martial arts.</a></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3559-lanaya","name":"Lanaya","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3559_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"960"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-01T02:52:06-08:00","id":746242,"title":"","content":"I'd say what needs to be corrected is where you cannot make Decisive attacks when you are crashed, but then you can crashed have people throwing out Decisive attacks to reset themselves to base, not caring whether they damage anyone or not.<br /> <br /> That said, where the text of a Charm contradicts the standard combat rules, I'd defer to the Charm's for the use of that Charm only.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;From now on, instead of saying 'half-assed', I will use 'muled'. 'This is a muled job, Chris', I will say to my friend Chris. 'You need to do better, or your ass is grass. And not, like, metaphorical grass. There are weeds growing in there as we speak.'<br /> <br /> &quot;'The DEA is after you, man' I will tell him, in all seriousness.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8891-khantalas","name":"Khantalas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8891_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"899"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}